{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":2,"title":"숫자 앞에 0 채우기","desc":"<p>정수 <code>n</code>을 <b>자릿수가 <code>width</code></b>가 되도록 앞에 0을 채운 문자열로 돌려주는 <code>pad_number(n, width)</code>를 만드세요. 이미 더 길면 그대로 둬요. 예: <code>(7, 3)</code> → <code>\"007\"</code></p>","solution":"pad_number <- function(n, width) {\n  formatC(n, width = width, flag = \"0\")\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>formatC(값, width = 폭, flag = \"0\")</code></p>","tests":[{"call":"pad_number(7, 3)","expected":"007","visible":true},{"call":"pad_number(123, 2)","expected":"123","visible":true},{"call":"pad_number(0, 4)","expected":"0000","visible":false},{"call":"pad_number(45, 5)","expected":"00045","visible":false}],"starter":"pad_number <- function(n, width) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-329"}